From: Maciej Krüger <mkg20001@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 21:00:00 +0200
Subject: mmfd, l3roamd: raise CMake minimum version

CMake 4 removed compatibility with CMake < 3.5, so both fail to
configure at cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8.3).

diff --git a/net/mmfd/patches/0001-raise-CMake-minimum-version.patch b/net/mmfd/patches/0001-raise-CMake-minimum-version.patch
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/net/mmfd/patches/0001-raise-CMake-minimum-version.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+--- a/CMakeLists.txt
++++ b/CMakeLists.txt
+@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
+-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8.3)
++cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
+ project(MMFD C)
+
+ list(APPEND CMAKE_MODULE_PATH ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/cmake)
+
diff --git a/net/l3roamd/patches/0001-raise-CMake-minimum-version.patch b/net/l3roamd/patches/0001-raise-CMake-minimum-version.patch
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/net/l3roamd/patches/0001-raise-CMake-minimum-version.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+--- a/CMakeLists.txt
++++ b/CMakeLists.txt
+@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
+-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8.3)
++cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
+ project(L3ROAMD C)
+
+ INCLUDE(FindPkgConfig)
+
